{% import 'dashboard/_macros.html.twig' as ui %}
<section class="card" aria-labelledby="dd-h">
<h2 id="dd-h">The delivery daemon</h2>
<p>The delivery daemon claims queued send jobs, skips suppressed addresses (checking again right before each submission), builds each message (VERP return path, tracking, List-Unsubscribe headers) and submits it to Postfix on port 587.
It also follows Postfix's log and queue to record what happened to each message, and processes incoming bounces and complaints. Its responsibility ends when Postfix has accepted a message; from there Postfix delivers it. {{ ui.help('delivery-daemon') }}</p>
<p>Mode now: <span class="mode mode-{{ delivery.mode }}">{{ delivery.mode }}</span> — {{ delivery.explanation }}</p>
</section>
